{"doc_id":"doc_012","regions":[{"region_id":"r1","bbox":[254.0,436.0,1030.0,42.0],"text":"PinnacleTM Acetabular Cup System - Milestones and Accomplishments.","reading_order":0},{"region_id":"r2","bbox":[247.0,509.0,127.0,32.0],"text":"Milestone","reading_order":1},{"region_id":"r3","bbox":[1110.0,509.0,65.0,32.0],"text":"Date","reading_order":2},{"region_id":"r4","bbox":[285.0,558.0,448.0,31.0],"text":"Internal Project Core Team chartered.","reading_order":3},{"region_id":"r5","bbox":[1110.0,556.0,126.0,178.0],"text":"July 1999 Sept. 1999 May 2000 July 2000","reading_order":4},{"region_id":"r6","bbox":[248.0,606.0,1039.0,617.0],"text":"Sept. 1999 . Initial surgeon design meeting. May 2000 Received FDA clearance for metal shell and poly liner. July 2000 First clinical evaluation surgery of Pinnacle cup. . Introductory launch meetings held with sales organization Sept/Nov 2000 . Nov. 2000 First launch phase to expanded surgeon base. Received FDA clearance for 28mm & 36mm metal inserts. Nov/Dec 2000 . Achieved first million dollars of sales for Pinnacle system. Jan. 2001 . Received confirmation of successful test results for ceramic inserts. Feb. 2001 March 2001 First metal-on-metal (28mm) case performed using Pinnacle. . March 2001 Achieved first million dollar sales month. First implantation of 36mm metal insert. April 2001 Achieved first $2M sales month. June 2001 . 36mm Marathon liners introduced on scheduled. July 2001","reading_order":5},{"region_id":"r7","bbox":[271.0,1239.0,465.0,35.0],"text":"Introduction of Pinnacle lipped liners.","reading_order":6},{"region_id":"r8","bbox":[1118.0,1242.0,111.0,26.0],"text":"Nov 2001","reading_order":7},{"region_id":"r9","bbox":[250.0,1330.0,302.0,34.0],"text":"Operations achievements:","reading_order":8},{"region_id":"r10","bbox":[295.0,1384.0,964.0,246.0],"text":"Successfully appropriated, purchased, installed, and performed verification on 12 . pieces of new CNC machinery. Developed extensive tracking system to meet and exceed planned launches. . Created manufacturing cell to produce shells and liners with positive impact on productivity. Reduction in scrap rate over last six months from ~1 1% to currently ~ 3.5%.","reading_order":9},{"region_id":"r11","bbox":[572.0,299.0,401.0,39.0],"text":"Special Recognition Award","reading_order":10}],"output_file":null,"runtime_seconds":null}
