{"doc_id":"doc_025","regions":[{"region_id":"r1","bbox":[234.0,220.0,360.0,30.0],"text":"World Congress of Gynecological","reading_order":0},{"region_id":"r2","bbox":[653.0,222.0,625.0,28.0],"text":"This is a very well focussed meeting. When one has a new","reading_order":1},{"region_id":"r3","bbox":[232.0,268.0,154.0,29.0],"text":"Endocrinology","reading_order":2},{"region_id":"r4","bbox":[649.0,270.0,669.0,75.0],"text":"progestin to introduce, this is certainly one of the meetings to attend. The level of science is usually good and the number of","reading_order":3},{"region_id":"r5","bbox":[231.0,313.0,316.0,31.0],"text":"September, Wroclaw, Poland","reading_order":4},{"region_id":"r6","bbox":[647.0,360.0,378.0,30.0],"text":"delegates is likely to be 1200-1500","reading_order":5},{"region_id":"r7","bbox":[232.0,425.0,354.0,30.0],"text":"The North American Menopause","reading_order":6},{"region_id":"r8","bbox":[652.0,426.0,716.0,29.0],"text":"This is usually a slightly disappointing meeting and is not very well","reading_order":7},{"region_id":"r9","bbox":[230.0,472.0,198.0,75.0],"text":"Society (NAMS) October, Chicago","reading_order":8},{"region_id":"r10","bbox":[652.0,476.0,709.0,28.0],"text":"attended. If it is important to spread the Totelle message across the","reading_order":9},{"region_id":"r11","bbox":[650.0,519.0,645.0,31.0],"text":"USA, however, Wyeth should be represented at this meeting","reading_order":10},{"region_id":"r12","bbox":[234.0,585.0,366.0,27.0],"text":"American Society of Reproductive","reading_order":11},{"region_id":"r13","bbox":[654.0,582.0,703.0,33.0],"text":"This meeting is always well attended - there will probably be 5000","reading_order":12},{"region_id":"r14","bbox":[230.0,632.0,106.0,25.0],"text":"Medicine","reading_order":13},{"region_id":"r15","bbox":[645.0,632.0,113.0,27.0],"text":"delegates","reading_order":14},{"region_id":"r16","bbox":[230.0,678.0,173.0,27.0],"text":"October, Seattle","reading_order":15},{"region_id":"r17",